cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use or refer to these archived research notebooks,
  please cite this repository using the metadata below.
type: software
title: "SEM Defect Classification with VAE-Based Data Augmentation"
authors:
  - family-names: "Köchl"
    given-names: "Alexander"
abstract: >-
  Archived research notebooks for SEM defect classification
  using a frozen ResNet50V2 backbone, VAE-based minority-class
  data augmentation, and conformal prediction.
  The repository preserves historical experiment outputs
  and documents methodological limitations.
repository-code: "https://github.com/divineteso-ai/semiconductor-defect-classification"
url: "https://github.com/divineteso-ai/semiconductor-defect-classification"
keywords:
  - semiconductor defect classification
  - scanning electron microscopy
  - variational autoencoder
  - data augmentation
  - conformal prediction
